  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcStoryArc
  npcId: tariq
  title: Maple Lane
  summary: "Tariq busks in the plaza and wants to record a real album. Sterling Coffee takes over his city caf\xE9 gig, then Sterling's marketing team offers a lot of money for his best song as an advert jingle. Fork: keep the song and record it cheaply, or sell it."
  pathAName: Keep the song
  pathBName: Sell the song
  parts:
