      counters: []
    pages:
    - Gus sat through my whole set again. Arms crossed, face like a thunderstorm. 'Too modern,' he says.
    - But on the slow song, the third one, his lips move. Every word. I've seen it. Don't tell him I've seen it.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
