      friendship: 0
  - title: "No more caf\xE9"
    number: 6
    heartsNeeded: 6
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - "My Friday gig in the city's gone. The caf\xE9 was sold. It's a Sterling Coffee now."
    - The new manager said 'we have a curated playlist'. Curated! It's forty songs on a loop, and they're all about being happy in an office.
    - Fridays were the only paid gig I had. Now it's the plaza or nothing.
    happy: 0
    ask:
