      replyB: []
      flagsB: []
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: Sterling Lane
    number: 8
    heartsNeeded: 8
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - "I have to answer by Friday. The day I used to play the caf\xE9, funnily enough."
    - If I sell it, I get the money, I make the album, and every time I go into the city I hear my own song telling people to buy flat-pack doors.
    - If I keep it, I record it myself, on Frank's old tape machine in his storeroom. Cheap. Rough. Mine.
    - You gave me the sunfish. You're in this song. You get a vote.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
      enabled: 1
      optionA: Keep the song
      replyA:
      - Keep it. Yeah. It's called Maple Lane. It's not called anything else.
      - Frank's storeroom it is. Bea says the echo's terrible. Bea says that about every room I'm in.
      flagsA:
      - tariq_kept_song
      optionB: Sell the song
      replyB:
      - Sell it. Money for an album. Proper drums. A proper studio.
      - I'll just... not go into the tower. Ever. Simple.
      flagsB:
      - tariq_sold_song
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: Somebody paid
    number: 9
    heartsNeeded: 9
    path: 1
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
